      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Share Repurchases",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "On August 21, 2025, the Board of Directors approved an update to the number of shares available under our previous share repurchase authorization so that the aggregate number of shares available for repurchase as of such date was 20.0 million.",
